### CHECKLIST
### ============================================

# After running all tests, verify:
# [ ] Can create unassigned tasks (Test 1)
# [ ] Can create assigned tasks (Test 2)
# [ ] Can get all tasks (Test 3)
# [ ] Can get task by ID (Test 4)
# [ ] Can update task (Test 5)
# [ ] Can update status (Test 6)
# [ ] Can add comments (Test 7)
# [ ] Can get comments (Test 8)
# [ ] Can delete comments (Test 9)
# [ ] Can get audit history (Test 10)
# [ ] Can get subtasks (Test 11)
# [ ] AI decompose works (Test 12)
# [ ] Can delete tasks (Test 13)
# [ ] Deleted tasks return 404 (Test 14)
# [ ] Edge cases handled correctly
# [ ] Validation errors return 400
# [ ] Filters work correctly
# [ ] Search works correctly

### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================

# 1. Replace {{baseUrl}} with your actual API URL
# 2. Replace {{accessToken}} with a valid JWT token
# 3. Replace {{userId}} with your user ID
# 4. After creating a task, copy the ID and set {{taskId}}
# 5. After creating a comment, copy the ID and set {{commentId}}
# 6. All tests should pass without errors
# 7. The main fix was making assignedToUserId optional (Test 1)
